      "message": "feat(ui): one armed/idle style for every Pick button\n\nAdd pick_button / pick_widget in egui_app/pick_button.rs: the armed pick\ncarries the selection fill and a stroke, an idle pick a faint tint.\nBoundary, setup, WCS, locate and tool-body pick buttons use it. No\nbehaviour or command change.\n\nFixes #1728\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
